      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOPE I CAN (4) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and five placings from 10 starts. Recorded a 1.3 lengths win (16.98) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. TODOROKI (8) was among the minors three back at this track then missed the frame the last two, but drawn box 8 this time where she has won before. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. CYCLONE SKYLAH (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (17.61) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here sound including two wins. The form out of last race has been strong. Great chance to atone. MAKE A MILE (1) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
